Adapted code
------------

The deployment and infrastructure code (the VPS installer and operator scripts
in install.sh, scripts/ and docker/vps/, the Compose files, the Dockerfile and
entrypoint, the Render and DigitalOcean manifests, the Cloudflare cron Worker,
the release workflows, the background job runtime and the split-frontend
gateway) was adapted from the Space Works Workspace project, which is also
licensed AGPL-3.0-or-later and copyright Space Works contributors.

The colour-mode reveal (components/providers.tsx, lib/colorModeReveal.ts) and
Patch's walk on the 404 page (components/feedback/NotFoundPet.tsx,
lib/patch/pet.ts, app/styles/patch.css) were adapted from the Space Works
Events project (via Space Works Machines), also AGPL-3.0-or-later and copyright
Space Works contributors. Patch's artwork comes from the Space Works design
system (SpaceWorks-Design, mascot/compressed/walk).


